Backport of upstream pull request #314 (waltmck), rebased onto v2.2.0 and
stacked on upstream-fetch-to-store-nix-2.36.patch: download progress bars
from FileTransfer activities.

Nix nests FileTransfer activities under the activity which requested them.
This records the parent activity id on every start action and shows
builder-reported transfers (e.g. a fixed-output derivation fetching its
source) grouped by build, and avoids a divide-by-zero when nix reports an
expected size of zero.

Requires the #313 patch (its Parser hunk expects the FetchToStoreType
start-action case).

https://github.com/maralorn/nix-output-monitor/pull/314

